---
args: { decisions: DecisionAtom[], prepared: PreparedEvidence, input: CaseInput }
returns: DraftMonitoringTask
---
Construct a MonitoringTask draft with its actual domain fields. Only supported values enter `values`; preserve conflicts, missing fields and evidence bindings. Design monitoring that can distinguish progress, nonresponse, and unintended effects using supplied methods. Specify comparable locations, timing, and effort, and define what evidence would justify continuing, revising, or stopping an intervention.
